  "description": "Meet Cute Presents: My Date With Lainey Lee, an audio romantic comedy. When hardworking NYU freshman Brooke and her aspiring-influencer bestie Evan sign up to be extras on the set of queer teen heartthrob Lainey Lee’s first movie, they don’t expect to get fired by Lainey Lee herself. But when Brooke confronts her celebrity crush, Lainey vows to make it up to them. What starts as a bite to eat leads to a romantic romp about New York City, a first kiss that accidentally goes viral, and a decision that just might end the blooming romance before it begins. Binge the full story here.",
